### Changelog (public, no token) — read from apps/copor/server/changelog/<version>.md

### Every version with its date, newest first
GET {{host}}/help/changelog
x-Version: {{x-version}}

### One version (content without the RELEASES block, plus the parsed download links)
GET {{host}}/help/changelog/1.0.0
x-Version: {{x-version}}

### The newest version (app installation page, login page's install button)
GET {{host}}/help/changelog/latest
x-Version: {{x-version}}
